space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenjang Pendidikan</label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 bg-surface-container-low p-1 rounded-xl\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SD</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMP</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMA</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">SMK</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"py-1.5 rounded-lg text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-colors text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\">MADRASAH</button></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md\"><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kelas</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Kelas</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Mata Pelajaran</label><div class=\"relative\"><select class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\" disabled=\"\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih Mapel</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-space-xs\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kurikulum</label><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" checked=\"\" value=\"merdeka\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">Merdeka</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 p-2 px-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors flex-1\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container cursor-pointer\" name=\"kurikulum\" value=\"k13\"/><span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface\">2013 (K13)</span></label></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Jenis Acara</label><div class=\"relative\"><select required=\"\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 pr-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all appearance-none disabled:opacity-50\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\" selected=\"\">Pilih jenis acara</option><option value=\"17 Agustus (HUT RI)\">17 Agustus (HUT RI)</option><option value=\"Hari Guru Nasional\">Hari Guru Nasional</option><option value=\"Hari Ibu\">Hari Ibu</option><option value=\"Perpisahan Sekolah\">Perpisahan Sekolah</option><option value=\"Wisuda / Kelulusan\">Wisuda / Kelulusan</option><option value=\"Sumpah Pemuda\">Sumpah Pemuda</option><option value=\"Hari Pendidikan Nasional\">Hari Pendidikan Nasional</option><option value=\"Hari Kartini\">Hari Kartini</option><option value=\"Hari Anak Nasional\">Hari Anak Nasional</option><option value=\"Acara Lainnya (Custom)\">Acara Lainnya (Custom)</option></select><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-2.5 text-on-surface-variant text-[20px]\">expand_more</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Tema Pidato</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: Pentingnya literasi digital bagi generasi muda\" class=\"w-full h-11 px-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all disabled:opacity-50\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Durasi Pidato: <span class=\"text-primary font-bold\">±<!-- -->5<!-- --> menit</span></label><input type=\"range\" min=\"3\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" class=\"w-full accent-primary-container\" value=\"5\"/><div class=\"flex justify-between text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant\"><span>3 menit</span><span>15 menit</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Gaya Bahasa</label><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container\" name=\"gaya\" value=\"formal\"/><span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface\">Formal (resmi, upacara)</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container\" name=\"gaya\" checked=\"\" value=\"semi-formal\"/><span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface\">Semi-Formal (sekolah, acara kelas)</span></label><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer\"><input type=\"radio\" class=\"w-4 h-4 accent-primary-container\" name=\"gaya\" value=\"santai\"/><span class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface\">Santai (pertemanan, osis)</span></label></div></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-sm disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">record_voice_over</span><span>Buat Teks Pidato</span></button></form><section class=\"mt-space-xl pt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-md\"><div class=\"mb-2\"><h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">help</span>Panduan &amp; FAQ: Generator Teks Pidato</h2><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 max-w-3xl\">Pertanyaan seputar pembuatan teks pidato otomatis untuk siswa dan guru SD, SMP, SMA.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Bisakah generator ini membuat pidato untuk acara 17 Agustus yang panjang?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Bisa. Gunakan slider durasi untuk mengatur panjang pidato hingga 15 menit (sekitar 2.000 kata). Sistem AI TugasMu akan otomatis menyesuaikan jumlah poin isi dan elaborasi berdasarkan durasi yang kamu pilih. Untuk pidato resmi upacara, pilih gaya bahasa <strong>Formal</strong>.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah hasil pidato ini bisa langsung dibacakan di acara sekolah?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Ya, teks pidato yang dihasilkan sudah memiliki struktur lengkap: pembuka (salam + ucapan terima kasih), isi (minimal 3 poin utama), dan penutup (kesimpulan + doa). Kamu hanya perlu mengganti bagian <strong>[nama pembicara]</strong> dan <strong>[nama sekolah]</strong> sesuai dengan identitasmu.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Bagaimana cara membuat pidato perpisahan yang menyentuh hati?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Pilih acara <strong>Perpisahan Sekolah</strong> dan gaya bahasa <strong>Semi-Formal</strong>. Isi tema dengan detail spesifik, misalnya: &quot;Kenangan tiga tahun bersama, harapan untuk masa depan yang cerah.&quot; Semakin spesifik tema yang kamu tuliskan, semakin personal dan menyentuh hasil pidatonya.</p></div></div></details><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah generator ini bisa digunakan oleh guru untuk membuat naskah MC?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><p>Tentu saja. Guru dapat menggunakan fitur ini untuk membuat naskah pembawa acara (MC) dengan memilih acara yang sesuai dan mengatur tema pada format acara yang diinginkan. Untuk naskah MC, disarankan memilih gaya <strong>Semi-Formal</strong> agar terdengar natural saat dibawakan.</p></div></div></details></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-heading\">TugasMu.com</span></div><span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500\">© 2026 TugasMu.com. Hak cipta dilindungi.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Beranda</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/privasi\">Privacy Policy</a><a